      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      571.59,
      298.21,
      655.66
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. KU/PDE/2022/85 and dated 25.09.2022, prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village of Pahala Moragane in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 1383 of Moragane in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Panduwasnuwara East in the District of Kurunegala in Northwestern Province and bounded as follows:",
